<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Unipetrol sees gross 97 profit 3.7 bln CZK.</title>
<headline>Czech Unipetrol sees gross 97 profit 3.7 bln CZK.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech petrochemical group Unipetrol a.s.,  expected to be listed soon on the Prague Stock Exchange, has forecast  gross consolidated pre-tax profit for 1997 of 3.7 billion crowns,  financial director Radomil Stepanek told a news conference on Friday.</p>
</text>
